new
lang ru
select normandy
march
time 3
world wait arrived 30
time pause
world focus
world supplypanel
state 00-before
shot 00-start
wait 45
expect WorldConvoyCount 1
state 01-dispatched
shot 01-dispatched-ru
time 3
world wait delivered 30
time pause
state 02-delivered
shot 02-delivered-ru
remember delivered
save
load
same delivered
expect WorldHasArena False
quit
